# --- Altium Cleanup ---
History/
__Previews/
__Backup/
*.Logs*
Project\ Logs*/

# --- Output Management ---
# 1. Ignore all output folders entirely
Project\ Outputs*/

# 2. Allow Git to look into the folders
!Project\ Outputs*/

# 3. Whitelist ONLY the files needed for Fabrication & Assembly
!Project\ Outputs*/*.GTL
!Project\ Outputs*/*.GBL
!Project\ Outputs*/*.GTS
!Project\ Outputs*/*.GBS
!Project\ Outputs*/*.GTO
!Project\ Outputs*/*.GBO
!Project\ Outputs*/*.GTP
!Project\ Outputs*/*.GBP
!Project\ Outputs*/*.GKO
!Project\ Outputs*/*.GML
!Project\ Outputs*/*.TXT
!Project\ Outputs*/*.DRL
!Project\ Outputs*/*.LDP

# 4. Whitelist Pick and Place (if you're doing PCBA/Assembly)
!Project\ Outputs*/*.csv

# --- System & Simulation Junk ---
Thumbs.db
*.aedtres/
*.p_bak